the realm  what's up ladies and gentlemen welcome  back for another game of thorns in A  Song of Ice and Fire update video what I  want to do today is go for some of the  things that George our Martin has had to  say about Game of Thrones as well as his  next book the winds of winter for the  most part George our Martin has stayed  relatively silent about the ending a  game of Thrones as well as when he  thinks the winds of winter will get  released over the years this has led to  many fans speculating about why they  think the winds of winter continues to  get delayed some say he was waiting for  Game of Thrones to end while others say  he will never release the next book also  he hasn't said a whole lot about what he  thinks of the final season a game of  Thrones  as you all know this universe is his  very own creation he has been writing a  song of ice and fire ever since the  1990s  when he finally agreed to let HBO adapt  his work into a television show he was  initially helping them bring it to life  on the screen every season he would even  write one of the episodes himself which  ended up becoming some of the best  episodes in this series like the Battle  of Blackwater Bay and the lion in the  Rose well it was right around a season  five when George started to distance  himself from the show that also happened  to be right around the same time when  the show was no longer following the  books ever since then he hasn't said  very much about the show this is one of  the many reasons why fans started to  think he was no longer liking the  direction the show was heading in well  now that it's finally over he did have  something to say I want to read exactly  what he wrote but like I said I also  want to read what he said about the  winds of winter now some of you may have  already seen this but I think most of  you will find it to be very interesting  like I did the very first thing I want  to look at is what was said about the  winds of winter since it has been  delayed so many times some think that  George was contractually obligated to  wait until Game of Thrones was over  before he could release it now this is  something that fans have been saying for  years but it wasn't until one of the  actors from Game of Thrones said it that  led to George actually having to come  out and address it because he did not  want everyone thinking that it was true  during an interview the actor who we all  knew as Barristan Selmy decided to say  this for whatever reason here's what he  had to say  George has already written book six and  seven George in the personal space and  as far as he is concerned thorough dr7  bonus for you or cc or C but he struck  an agreement with David and the  showrunners a series  geniuses that he would not  so as you can see this game of thrones  actor said George not only had the winds  of winter done but he also had a dream  of spring done which is said to be the  final book in the A Song of Ice and Fire  series as soon as fans heard this it  started to spread across the internet  like wildfire well it eventually made  its way to george RR martin and he was  not very happy about it now most of the  time he would not even acknowledge  something like this but since one of the  actor said it he felt like he should say  something before everyone starts to  believe it now let's look at what George  had to say internet journalism is an  oxymoron I am more and more convinced of  late it seems there's a new story about  me somewhere on the net everyday or near  enough to make no matter many get things  wrong for the most part I ignore them I  have better things to do than to try and  track down every weird rumor or out an  out fabric ation that pops up on some  obscure website trolling for traffic  every so often however one of those  stories gains an improbable currency and  just chuckling at the insanity no longer  suffices  that seems to be happening right now all  of a sudden this crazy story about me  finishing the winds of winter and a  dream of spurring years ago is popping  up everywhere no I am NOT going to  provide links I don't want to reward  purveyors of misinformation with hits I  will however say for the record no the  winds of winter in a dream of spring are  not finished dream has not even begun I  am NOT going to start writing volume 7  until I finish volume 6 it seems absurd  to me that I need to state this the  world is round the earth revolves around  the Sun water is wet do I need to say  that too it boggles me that anyone would  believe this story even for an instant  it makes not a whit a sense why would I  sit for years on completed novels why  would my publishers not just here in the  US but all around the world ever consent  to this they make millions and millions  of dollars every time a new Ice and Fire  book comes out as do i delaying makes no  sense  why would HBO want the books delayed the  books help create interest in the show  just as the show creates interest in the  books  no the books are not done HBO did not  ask me to delay them nor did David and  Dan there is no deal to hold back on the  books I assure you  HBO and David and Dan would both have  been thrilled and delighted if the winds  of winter had been delivered and  published four or five years ago and no  one would have been more delighted than  me I have said it before don't believe  everything you read on the Internet  except here of course so as you can see  he shot this down almost immediately the  actor who said it during the interview  most likely read something on the  internet then decided to say it because  it sounded reasonable enough we all  would like to think that he would have  had this book done by now if you look at  every other release date for his books  in the ax Song of Ice and Fire series it  has never taken him this long to finish  a book a game of Thrones first came out  back on August 1st 1996 he started  working on this story literally decades  ago the next book that came out a Clash  of Kings was released on November 16  1998 so from the time the first book  came out until the second book came out  there was only a two year in three month  gap then his next book a Storm of Swords  came out at the end of the year 2000 so  it was basically another two years to  finish another book now the next book a  feast for crows is when he really starts  to slow down a feast for crows doesn't  come out until the Year 2005 that is a  five-year wait for the next book then it  was almost six years until a dance with  dragons came out now we are waiting for  the winds of winter and this one has  taken longer than any of the other books  it has almost been eight years since the  dance of dragons came out so you can  kind of understand why some fans would  think that he has to be already done  well let's see what George had to say he  gave a winds of winter update only a few  days ago he starts off by saying I was  surprised last night when Air New  Zealand went to the Internet to invite  me down for a visit to help me finish my  book then he basically goes on to say  how he has been there before and how  much he loves to visit but at the very  end he does sort of give an update on  the status of the winds of winter he  says as for finishing my book I fear  that New Zealand would distract me  entirely too much best leave me here in  Westeros for the nonce but I tell you  this  I don't have the winds of winter in hand  when I arrived in New Zealand for  Worldcon you have my here formal written  permission to imprison me in a small  cabin on white island overlooking that  lake a sulfuric acid until I'm done just  so long as the acidic fumes do not screw  up my old dos word processor I'll be  fine  so what he more or less says is there is  no reason why he should not have the  winds of winter done by the end of the  next year now of course he has said very  similar things before he said he should  be done in 2015 2016 2017 but it  continued to get delayed every single  year however I myself am fairly  optimistic I do happen to think he is  very close to getting it done he hasn't  given himself a deadline in quite some  time so considering he is now saying  this I would like to believe him as we  all know the ending a game of Thrones  was so heavily criticized I think it may  have motivated him even more to get it  done soon so now that you have seen what  he said about the winds of winter let's  see what George said after Game of  Thrones was over he said the last night  the last show after eight epic seasons  HBO's Game of Thrones series has come to  an end it is hard to believe that it is  over if truth be told the years have  gone by in the blink of an eye can it  really have been more than a decade  since my manager set up a meeting at the  palm in LA and I sat down for the first  time with David Benioff and DB Weiss for  a lunch that lasted well past dinner I  did ask them if they knew who Jon Snow's  mother was fortunately they did that was  how it started it ended last night I had  no clue that afternoon at the poem that  I was about to embark on a journey that  would change my life I had optioned  books and stories for television and  film before and some had even been made  there was no way to know that this was  going to be different that this pilot  would not only be shot but would go on  to become the most successful show in  the history of HBO when a record number  of Emmy Awards and become the most  popular and most pirated show in the  world and transform a group of talented  but largely unknown actors into major  celebrities and stars even less that I  imagined that I would somehow become a  celebrity as well and if truth be told  I'm still not sure how that happened it  has been a wild ride to say the least I  want to thank people by  there are so many there were 42 cast  members at the season 8 premiere in New  York City and that wasn't even all of  them and the crew though less visible  than the cast were no less important we  had some amazing people working on this  show as all those Emmys bear witness  David and Dan assembled a championship  team the directors were incredible as  well I should start naming names but  then I'd miss someone there were so many  but I do need to mention David Benioff  Dan Weiss and Bryan cogman the third  head of the Dragon as I said in the  recent Vanity Fair piece about him and  of course the great team at HBO any  other network and Game of Thrones would  not have been what it became most other  networks this series never gets made at  all I could go on and on and have as  I've been writing this post in my head  but there's really too much to say  parting is such sweet sorrow The Bard  wrote in the weeks and months to come  I'm a post about some of my favorite  moments from the making of the show now  and again when I am feeling nostalgic  but just now there are so many memories  and no time to do them all justice let  me say this much last night wasn't  ending but it was also a beginning  nobody is retiring anytime soon David  and Dane are going on a Star Wars and  other projects beyond that Amazon  scooped up Bryan cogman and put him to  work on developing shows of his own as  well as helping out on their big Tolkien  projects our brilliant cast has  scattered to the four winds but you'll  be seeing a lot of them in the years to  come in all manners a television shows  and movies our directors are keeping  busy as well I suspect that you have not  seen the last of Westeros on your  television sets either but I guess that  all depends on how some of these  successor shows turn out and me I'm  still here and I'm still busy as a  producer I've got five shows in  development at HBO some having nothing  whatsoever to do with the world of  Westeros I have to at Hulu one on the  History Channel I'm involved with a  number of feature projects some based  upon my own stories and books and some  material created by others there are  these short films that I'm hoping to  make adaptions a classic stories by one  of the most brilliant quirky and  original writers our genre has ever  produced and I'm writing winter  coming I told you long ago and so it is  the winds of winter is very late I know  I know but it will be done I won't say  when I've tried that before only to burn  you all in jinx myself but I will finish  it and then will come a dream of spring  how will it end  I hear people asking the same ending as  the show different well yes and no and  yes and no and yes and no and yes I am  working in a very different medium than  David and Dan never forget they had six  hours for the final season I am  expecting these last two books of mine  well Phil 3000 manuscript pages between  them before I'm done and if more pages  and chapters and scenes are needed I'll  add them and of course the butterfly  effect will be at work as well those of  you who follow this not a blog will know  that I've been talking about this in  season one there are characters who  never made it onto the screen at all and  others who died in this show but still  live in the books so if nothing else the  readers will learn what happened to all  of the other characters book or show  which will be the real ending it's a  silly question how many children did  Scarlett O'Hara have how about this I'll  write it you read it then everyone can  make up their own mind and argue about  it on the internet so at the end of the  day I know I'm still very optimistic  about the future I believe we will get  the winds of winter very soon as well as  another show that is based on his a Song  of Ice and Fire universe like George  said Game of Thrones might be over but I  suspect this will not be the last time  that we visit Westeros on our  televisions so let me know what you  think about these updates leave me some  of your thoughts down below once again I  want to thank everyone for stopping by  to watch another video and I also want  to thank everyone for supporting the  channel I hope you have a great day I  will see you again very soon bye  you  [Music]  you

